{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33964","headline":"夏首病愈因招鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"夏首病愈因招鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓入清和尚袷衣，夏阴初合掩双扉。\n一声拨谷桑柘晚，数点舂锄烟雨微。\n贫养山禽能个瘦，病关芳草就中肥。\n明朝早起非无事，买得蓴丝待陆机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}